# Altium generated / local-only artifacts.
#
# Everything here is either regenerable, machine-specific, or grows without
# bound. If Altium starts producing something not listed, add it — the list is
# not exhaustive and only gets accurate by running the tool.

# Altium's own local history. Keeps a copy of every save and reaches
# gigabytes on an active project. Git is the history; this is not.
History/
__Previews/

# Generated at build/output time
Project Outputs for */
Project Logs for */
Project Group Outputs for */
*.PrjPcbStructure
*.SchDocPreview
*.PcbDocPreview
*.SchLibPreview
*.PcbLibPreview

# Temp, autosave, backups
*.$$$
*.~*
*.bak
.AutoSave*
*.Nav

# Per-user workspace state, not design intent
*.DsnWrk
*.PrjPcbVariants

# Working output directory (see README — fab packages go in releases/ instead)
*/outputs/
